          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"></circle>
              <polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Photograph (Max 80 KB)</h3>
          <p>
            Recent color passport photograph (30 × 45 mm / 10–80 KB JPG) taken within the last 6 months against a plain white background (#FFFFFF) with min 150 DPI and full frontal view.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-card">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M17 3a2.828 2.828 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Signature (Max 80 KB)</h3>
          <p>
            Digital signature scan strictly between 5 KB and 80 KB JPG (80 × 35 mm / 400 × 175 px). Must be signed with a black or dark blue ink pen in continuous running handwriting on clean white paper.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-card">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
              <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
              <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
              <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Test Day Admit Card Hard Copies</h3>
          <p>
            Candidates must print and carry identical physical copies of the uploaded photograph to paste onto the CAT Admit Card in the presence of the test room invigilator on exam day.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3: Official Specifications Table -->
      <h2>Official 2026 IIM CAT Image Specifications Summary Table</h2>
      <p>
        Review the officially verified dimensions, file sizes, and background criteria across CAT application categories:
      </p>

      <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="specs-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Application Category</th>
              <th>Document Type</th>
              <th>Target Dimensions</th>
              <th>Allowed File Size</th>
              <th>Format &amp; Background</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>General CAT (Universal)</strong></td>
              <td>Photograph<br />Signature</td>
              <td>350 × 450 px (30 × 45 mm)<br />400 × 175 px (80 × 35 mm)</td>
              <td>10 KB – 80 KB (&le;80 KB)<br />5 KB – 80 KB (&le;80 KB)</td>
              <td>JPG / Pure White BG (150+ DPI)<br />JPG / Running Handwriting</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>IIM PGP / MBA Entrance</strong></td>
              <td>Photograph<br />Signature</td>
              <td>350 × 450 px (30 × 45 mm)<br />400 × 175 px (80 × 35 mm)</td>
              <td>10 KB – 80 KB (&le;80 KB)<br />5 KB – 80 KB (&le;80 KB)</td>
